    "chunk_text": "w\u00e6\u00f0: So\u00f0lice ic syngode; Ic geseah betwux \u00f0am Iosue \u00f0a sende sona to his getelde, & man funde \u00f0a \u00f0ingc, swa swa he fores\u00e6de. & hi l\u00e6ddon Achar to Achores dene, mid wife, & mid cildum, & mid eallum \u00e6htum, & hine \u00f0\u00e6r & worhton mid stanum \u00e6nne steapne beorh him ofer; & Godes hatheortnys gecyrde sona fram \u00f0am DRIHTEN cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Iosue: Ne ondr\u00e6d \u00f0u \u00f0e nan \u00f0ingc: nim \u00f0\u00e6s folces m\u00e6niu & far \u00f0e to Hai: \u00f0a Do ymb \u00f0a burh, swa \u00f0u dydest embe Hiericho; habba\u00f0 eow \u00f0a hu\u00f0e & \u00f0\u00e6t orf eow gem\u00e6ne; sete nu Iosue sende \u00f0a sona on \u00f0\u00e6re nihte \u00f0ritig \u00f0usend wera to \u00f0\u00e6ra searwa stowe, & het hi beon gearwe & \u00d0onne fare ge to, mid \u00f0am \u00f0e we fleonde beo\u00f0, & gega\u00f0 \u00f0a burh & forb\u00e6rna\u00f0 hi sona. Hi dydon \u00f0a swa swa him dihte Iosue. & he sylf on \u00e6rnemerigen mid \u00f0am o\u00f0rum flocce to \u00f0\u00e6re byrig ferde beotlice mid wige. Hi geseah \u00f0a se cyningc \u00f0e s\u00e6t on \u00f0\u00e6re byrig, & gewende of \u00f0\u00e6re byrig mid ealre \u00f0are buruhware & Iosue \u00f0a fleah, swylce he afyrht w\u00e6re, mid eallum his here andlang \u00f0\u00e6s westenes. & \u00f0a o\u00f0re hrymdon hridende him \u00e6fter. Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00f0a to Iosue: Ahefe \u00f0inne sc",
